d":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-label","content":"A radio group using `aria-label` instead of a visible label."},"1181":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-37","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#form-submission","content":"A radio group integrated with native form submission."},"1182":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-38","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#customization","content":"`RadioGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Radio` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Radio` takes label text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."},"1183":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-39","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-40","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-41","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-42","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a radio field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive radio state:"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-43","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-44","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-45","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-46","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-47","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-support","content":"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-48","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-support","content":"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-49","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-support","content":"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-50","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-support","content":"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-51","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#aria-support","content":"`aria-required` when selection is required"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-52","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#