cture","content":"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."},"1400":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-12","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."},"1401":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-13","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1402":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-14","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1403":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-15","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`ButtonGroup`** - a cluster of related actions (a wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`). Overlay parents like `Modal` adopt it with end alignment and padding."},"1404":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-16","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."},"1405":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-17","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Each container works in two modes:"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-18","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tag