iple data series with grouped bars"],[1300,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[834,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[490,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1634,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[939,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1303,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1741,"**Space / Enter**"],[1190,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[297,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[882,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1350,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[709,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[719,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1406,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[938,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1875,"**Sticky axes*